    "sections": {
        "description": "Bosa Travel Agency is a fast, lightweight WordPress theme for accommodation, adventure, booking, destination, modern blog, personal blog, tour, travel, travel affiliate, travel blog, travel blogger, travel guide, travel html, travel magazine, and travel site template sites, built for Elementor and WooCommerce. Launch your site visually - no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in mind, Bosa Travel Agency supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa Travel Agency also works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-powered content generation."
